# ─── SANCTUARY-SPECIFIC ────────────────────────────────────
helper.md
generate_blueprint.py
plugins/*

# Release artifacts (signed builds live on disk + device, never in git)
release/

# src-tauri/gen/ is DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED (2026-08-16, KP's word). Tauri's own
# src-tauri/.gitignore covers /target and /gen/schemas, and tauri android init
# writes gitignores inside gen/android for build/, .gradle/ and keystore.properties.
# gen/android is hand-edited ground; ignoring it hid two cross-landings from git.

# ─── a downloaded credential file never rides (2026-08-28) ───────────────
# Google's client_secret JSON, service-account keys, token stores: their
# secret fields go on the keyring (.env) by hand; the file is deleted.
*client_secret*.json
*_secret*.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
token.json
*.credentials.json
